      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my son is 14 months old and has been having really bad diarrhea since yesterday. he's acting super sleepy/lethargic like he just wont wake up easy and i havent seen a wet diaper in like 8 hours now... i'm worried. can i just give him some diluted apple juice to try and get some fluids in him or do i really need to go to the ER?",
