    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really nervous about the ER bill and the waiting room with a sick baby. he just drank a little bit of juice and seems to be resting okay now. are you sure it's an emergency? couldn't i just try some Pedialyte or even just more juice for the next couple hours and see if he pees then?",
