      "content": "Do not give your baby any aspirin; aspirin is toxic to infants and should never be administered. While you can monitor him at home, visual checks are not enough when he is lethargic. The most reliable indicator of severe dehydration requires professional medical assessment, which is why an ER visit is strongly recommended. Please call your pediatrician immediately for guidance on when the situation escalates beyond home care.",
